# 例外：pikachu_v03 的交付录像要跟文档一起进库，方便事后 review。
# 注意 `videos/` 排除的是**目录**，必须先把目录本身重新包含进来，
# 否则下面针对文件的 `!` 规则不会生效（git 不会走进被排除的目录）。
!docs/pikachu_v03/videos/
!docs/pikachu_v03/evaluations/
!docs/pikachu_v03/evaluations/**/
!docs/pikachu_v03/evaluations/**/videos/
!docs/pikachu_v03/evaluations/**/videos/**
__pycache__/
*.pyc
MUJOCO_LOG.TXT
debug.py
.vscode/
*.ipynb_checkpoints/
motions/
*_rerun*
artifacts/
.venv/
render_robots.py
benchmark_results/

# Documentation outputs.
**/_build/*
**/generated/*

# Training artifacts under deploy corpus — never commit intermediates.
pre_train/**/events.out.tfevents.*
pre_train/**/torchrunx/
pre_train/**/model_*.pt
# Exception: allow final deploy checkpoints via git add -f if needed.
# Policy: only promote final model + onnx + metrics (see pre_train/README.md).
**/MUJOCO_LOG.TXT

# v03 速度报告的曲线缓存：7.5 MB，每次重跑都会重建，不是交付物。
# 它是 read_curves() 的中间产物（从 tensorboard event 里抽出来的曲线），
# 提交它只会在仓库里堆一个没人 review 的二进制。
docs/pikachu_v03/reports/.curve-cache.json

# Reproducible diagnostic outputs are synchronized as files, not source commits.
doc/**/metrics/
doc/**/plots/
doc/**/training_selected_scalars.csv
